<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of June 11.</p>
<p>				  June 11/June 10  June 11/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.11		 7.08</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 5.36</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.10		10.13</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.57		55.20</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.66		32.11</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.68		32.62</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.14		13.17</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.41		29.36</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.77		39.79</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.72		38.24</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.29		22.28</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    2.07		96.51</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,316,235,187,163</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,943,404,152,796</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,035,626,737,879</p>
<p>  International funds			    96,126,920,254</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    241,077,376,234</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
